IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. IF-NESTED.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 FLAG-A PIC X VALUE 'Y'.
01 FLAG-B PIC X VALUE 'N'.
01 RESULT-CODE PIC X.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    IF FLAG-A = 'Y'
       IF FLAG-B = 'Y' MOVE 'A' TO RESULT-CODE
       ELSE MOVE 'B' TO RESULT-CODE END-IF
    ELSE MOVE 'C' TO RESULT-CODE END-IF.
    STOP RUN.
